eral discounts for different products. However, I\'m unsure about how to apply the member-exclusive discounts that are mentioned in the menu section. Could you guide me on how this works?\n\nThanks,\nJane</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From:    Jane Doe <jane.doe@example.com>\nSent:    Monday, May 26, 2024 9:15 AM\nTo:      Customer Support <support@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Inquiry About Product Discounts\n\nHello,\n\nI was trying to navigate through your online portal and noticed several discounts for different products. However, I\'m unsure about how to apply the member-exclusive discounts that are mentioned in the menu section. Could you guide me on how this works?\n\nThanks,\nJane</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from jane doe sent monday may am to customer support support subject inquiry about product discounts hello trying navigate online portal noticed several discount different product however unsure apply discount mentioned menu section could guide work thanks jane</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
